WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.110
1975.

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.950
Rambouillet, near Paris.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.070
Six leaders meet: France,
West Germany, the USA,

4
00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.850
Japan, the UK and Italy.

5
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.330
Canada joins in 1976.

6
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.370
The G7 is born.

7
00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.410
In IMF data at purchasing power parity,

8
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:23.590
the G7 produced 51.8 per
cent of world output in 1980.

9
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.010
By 2025, 28.4 per cent.

10
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.230
Do the old clubs still
run the world economy?

11
00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.230
Or has the G7 simply faded away?

12
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.910
In this mission, you'll meet the G7, G20,

13
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:41.310
OECD and OPEC, and find out where
each one's power comes from.

14
00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:46.670
Then you'll follow oil power, from the
1973 embargo to the Strait of Hormuz in

15
00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.370
2026.

16
00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:53.000
Your mission: evaluate whether the
old clubs still run the world economy.
